  "title": "Imran Khan Jailed in Pakistan After Health Deterioration",
  "summary": "Pakistan’s former prime minister Imran Khan, who was previously removed from office in April 2022, has been taken to a hospital in the country’s capital after weeks of public protests over his deteriorating health and legal challenges.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Imran Khan was taken to Shifa International Hospital in Islamabad following supreme court orders.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The hospital was ordered to take him from Adiala jail, and his party’s spokesperson confirmed the transfer.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The transfer was ordered by the Supreme Court, highlighting the ongoing legal and health issues.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
